  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco presents the American Strength T-Shirt. Exhibit your industrial prowess and craftmanship with our American Strength T-Shirt. These iron-willed t-shirts are great for tradesmen, industry workers, mechanics, gearheads, carpenters, or anyone that turns a wrench.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133332",
  "description": "<p>Rothco presents the American Strength T-Shirt. Exhibit your industrial prowess and craftmanship with our American Strength T-Shirt. These iron-willed t-shirts are great for tradesmen, industry workers, mechanics, gearheads, carpenters, or anyone that turns a wrench.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Reliable and Durable Materials:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Go ahead and wear your American Strength T-Shirt without a worry! The durable 60% Cotton / 40% Polyester blend easily withstands a hard day&rsquo;s work.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>For the Rough and Tough:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These rugged workwear style shirts feature reinforced seams at the collar and sleeves that enhance the shirt&rsquo;s durability, and with a tag-less neck label, you&rsquo;re free to move around without any itches or scratches.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Good Ol&rsquo; American Ingenuity:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These graphic t-shirts are inspired by the tenacity and creativity of the American spirit. The main design is on the back, with crossed wrenches on the left chest, and an American Flag on the right sleeve.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Fits Like a Glove:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These reliable graphic shirts are standard fit, giving you the perfect amount of room and flexibility for any activity. Their length should go past the waist, providing you with additional coverage.</li>\n</ul>",
